@step Register the renewed file as a named certificate source, if it is not registered yet.
@static aeat config auth certificate register --name personal --file ./renewed-certificate.p12
@blocked credential-store Needs certificate custody in the OS credential store, absent from the sandbox.
@step Rotate the stored passphrase for that certificate source.
@static aeat config auth certificate secret set --name personal
@blocked interactive-tty Refuses with 'a secret is required but no interactive terminal is available'.
